{"id":8129,"date":"2021-10-16T19:20:06","date_gmt":"2021-10-16T23:20:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8129"},"modified":"2021-10-17T19:24:41","modified_gmt":"2021-10-17T23:24:41","slug":"campground-review-encampment-wy-city-park-campground","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/10\/16\/campground-review-encampment-wy-city-park-campground\/","title":{"rendered":"Campground Review &#8211; Encampment WY City Park Campground"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Free campsites.net told us this was a low cost city park with no frills and it was correct.  We really appreciate the city having this RV park for the weary travelers on their way south from Montana.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When we were there (mid-October) the water was shut off and the restrooms were closed, but that was ok as we always carry ample water to get us by for at least a couple days &#8220;just in case&#8221;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The sites are sand\/grass and mostly level.  There are 8 sites total, some with full hook-up and some with electric only.  There were only 3 picnic tables for 8 sites when we were there.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Senior Center and the Thrift Store are both right there within a hundred feet however we didn&#8217;t go into either.  The library is about 300 feet away and has free wifi we were able to connect to so that we could watch TV at night and be able to check email, etc.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There is NOTHING to do or see in town.  Oh &#8230; I take that back &#8211; there is a museum that I think would be cool to see but it was closed on the Friday we were there and is always closed on weekends.  <a href=\"https:\/\/gemuseum.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Here&#8217;s a link to the GEM<\/a> (Grand Encampment Museum) filled with artifacts\u00a0representing the timber, mining, and agricultural history of the Encampment valley.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Otherwise if you want gas or bread or a gallon of milk you have to drive to the next town, but not to worry it&#8217;s only a mile down the road and it has two restaurants, a charming grocery\/hardware\/video store, and car repair shop.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_131917229.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_131917229.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8137\" class=\"wp-image-8137\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_131917229.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_131917229-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_131917229-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Our site<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_151111147.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_151111147.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8130\" class=\"wp-image-8130\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_151111147.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_151111147-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_151111147-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Typical site surface<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_150201836.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_150201836.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8131\" class=\"wp-image-8131\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_150201836.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_150201836-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_150201836-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Antelope walk through town<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_143119259.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_143119259.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8132\" class=\"wp-image-8132\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_143119259.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_143119259-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_143119259-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The town Welcome sign<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142333328.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142333328.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8133\" class=\"wp-image-8133\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142333328.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142333328-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142333328-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The only store in town<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142109747.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142109747.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8134\" class=\"wp-image-8134\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142109747.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142109747-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142109747-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The grocery aisle<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/Encampment.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"254\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/Encampment.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8139\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/Encampment.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=8139\" class=\"wp-image-8139\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/Encampment.jpg 254w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/Encampment-141x300.jpg 141w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 254px) 100vw, 254px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">From Encampment City web site<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142034039.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142034039.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8135\" class=\"wp-image-8135\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142034039.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142034039-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211007_142034039-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The typical aisle in the hardware\/grocery store<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You might refer to this park as &#8220;rough&#8221; but the four of us were fine with it.  It was quiet, the few folks we met were friendly, we were allowed to connect to the wifi, and the lack of available water hook-up was not an inconvenience for us.  Each site identification post had a locked donation box on it and the police came by the park a couple times each day waived hello while we were there just to make sure everything was o.k.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We enjoyed our quiet stay there.  Next time we are in the area we will have to make sure the Grand Encampment Museum is going to be open the day(s) we visit.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for riding along with us once again.  We look forward to seeing you on down the road.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb and Kathy<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p> <\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Free campsites.net told us this was a low cost city park with no frills and it was correct. We really appreciate the city having this RV park for the weary travelers on their way south from Montana. When we were there (mid-October) the water was shut off and the restrooms were closed, but that was &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/10\/16\/campground-review-encampment-wy-city-park-campground\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Campground Review &#8211; Encampment WY City Park Campground<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554708023,13403,677,554708025,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707796,554708083,554708084,554708089,554708086,554708087,554708088,554708090,554707731],"class_list":["post-8129","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-campground-review","category-camping","category-friends","category-rving","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-city-park","tag-encampment","tag-gem","tag-library","tag-riverside","tag-saratoga","tag-senior-center","tag-wifi","tag-wyoming"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8129","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8129"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8129\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":8169,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8129\/revisions\/8169"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8129"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8129"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8129"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}